Package: pmxdchk
Title: Data Visualization and Quality Checking for Pharmacometric Datasets
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Runcheng", "Li", email = "runchengli1994@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application for visualization and data quality checking
    of NONMEM and ADPPK pharmacometric datasets. Supports interactive checks,
    individual and population PK plots, and exportable PDF reports.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/pharmaverse/pmxdchk
